WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.498
Is your photo folder one big mess?

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.852
One click on Organize is enough.

3
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:14.250
The photos land in tidy folders, by date and place. In this example: six photos in five folders.

4
00:00:14.983 --> 00:00:18.383
Try it: open Sort a photo folder and click Organize.
